# Impeccable + SSH (multi-project)

Do not hardcode one Impeccable or Next port.

**Boards:** `IMPECCABLE_QUESTION_FORCE=1` and auto-pick from **3457–3462**. Share the printed `http://localhost:<PORT>/`.

**Apps:** free port from **3000, 3456, 3463–3465**, bind `0.0.0.0`, tell the user the URL.

Always also list Impeccable option ids in chat.
